{"id":"wt_c2_08","name":"重金求得的药方","des":"德利特尔最近因为力量的问题感到焦虑。四处求医后，他得到了按时服用大力丸的处方。为他制作一颗大力丸吧。","des2":"随着大家渐渐恢复采矿工作，我发现我的运送速度有些跟不上了。我的力量不够，好几次工友们都调侃我，叫我“小小车夫”，我天生力气小有什么办法嘛！不过总这样也不是办法，我花大价钱去看了医生，医生给我开了一个处方，要求我要按照处方，每隔一段时间按时吃一颗大力丸。所以不管是谁，拜托了，请给我一颗大力丸吧！","type":3,"typeLabel":"委托","typeOrder":2,"subRaw":"C2","subLabel":"索利德山地","subKey":"C2","close":false,"reward":{"entries":[{"kind":"money","name":"银币","count":700,"rawMin":700,"rawMax":700,"min":700,"max":700,"countMin":700,"countMax":700,"typeId":"item_00001","icon":"/images/Common_ItemIcon/item_00001.webp","quality":5,"groupIndex":0,"groupRate":1,"groupCount":1,"actualProb":1,"cumulativeProb":1},{"kind":"item","name":"山地纪念币","count":7,"rawMin":7,"rawMax":7,"min":7,"max":7,"countMin":7,"countMax":7,"typeId":"item_29102","icon":"/Common_ItemIcon/item_29102.webp","quality":4,"groupIndex":1,"groupRate":1,"groupCount":1,"actualProb":1,"cumulativeProb":1},{"kind":"item","name":"赤剑草","count":3,"rawMin":3,"rawMax":3,"min":3,"max":3,"countMin":3,"countMax":3,"typeId":"item_10042","icon":"/Common_ItemIcon/item_10042.webp","quality":2,"groupIndex":2,"groupRate":1,"groupCount":1,"actualProb":1,"cumulativeProb":1}],"text":[]},"startLocation":"巴诺姆村（索利德山地）","startNpc":{"name":"“车夫”德利特尔","id":"cart_at_npc_delierte"},"getTask":{"npc":{"name":"“车夫”德利特尔","id":"cart_at_npc_delierte","line":"","kind":"cart"},"title":"“车夫”德利特尔","dialog":{"raw":"提交 1 份大力丸。","isText":true,"name":""},"condition":"开启索利德山地委托（完成主线《狂野的白兔》）"},"predecessorTasks":[],"addTasks":[],"unlockTasks":[],"unlockStages":[],"steps":[{"index":1,"name":"制作 1 份大力丸，提交给巴诺姆村的“车夫”德利特尔。","des":"德利特尔最近因为力量的问题感到焦虑。四处求医后，他得到了按时服用大力丸的处方。为他制作一颗大力丸吧。","type":"getItemNpc","typeName":"提交道具给NPC","reward":{"entries":[],"text":[]},"unlockStages":[],"unlockSuppressed":false,"detail":[{"label":"说明","value":"提交后扣除道具"},{"label":"NPC","value":"“车夫”德利特尔"},{"label":"房间","value":"巴诺姆村（索利德山地）"},{"label":"交互对话","value":"（提交大力丸。）"}],"dialogs":[{"label":"不满足条件","meta":{"raw":"wt_c2_08_1_n","isText":false,"na